  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera asks what comes next for the US tech company after a scandal involving Nvidia.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:00c04b1d51fa"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "In October 2026, Meta expressed intent for further use of Nvidia hardware for developing its Muse agent, and plans to incorporate almost all of Nvidia's planned upcoming enterprise products.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385947880:227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Nvidia Corporation is an American multinational technology company headquartered in Santa Clara, California.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385947880:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The company's headquarters is in Santa Clara, United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q182477:P159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Nvidia was founded in 1993 by Jensen Huang, Chris Malachowsky and Curtis Priem, and is led by Colette Kress.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q182477:P571",
        "wd:Q182477:P112",
        "wd:Q182477:P169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "Recorded revenue rose from $4.1 billion in 2007 to $215.9 billion in 2025.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q182477:P2139:series"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:50Z",
      "text": "Staff grew from 11,528 in 2018 to 42,000 in 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q182477:P1128:series"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "On record, the company owns Nvidia Ltd., Icera and 3 others, including Mellanox Technologies, Mental Images and Ageia.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q182477:P355:Q29000344",
        "wd:Q182477:P355:Q5985959",
        "wd:Q182477:P355:Q6817432",
        "wd:Q182477:P355:Q6813052",
        "wd:Q182477:P1830:Q392357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:01:08Z",
      "text": "Hacker News recorded 209 stories mentioning Nvidia in the two weeks to 13 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "hn:2026-11-13:Q182477"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:01:26Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined its piece: “Nvidia scandal: What’s next for the US tech company?”",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:00c04b1d51fa"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:01:33Z",
      "text": "France 24 headlined its piece: “Nvidia scandal: How close was ex-CEO to Trump?”",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:b0c156ec823c"
      ]
    },
    {
